<PracticeSet />

<AtTheTable>

Group comparable opportunities before estimating a tendency. Keep the prior and sample count visible, and avoid overreacting to a few public actions.

</AtTheTable>

<QuantCorner>

Small-sample forecasting benefits from explicit uncertainty about the rate itself. Predictive variation includes both future outcome noise and uncertainty in the underlying parameter.

</QuantCorner>
